        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "The animated GIF (12 frames, 800×600) is colored with a LUT sampled from the vendored micrograph and scores cv_sim_similarity 87.6 by the canonical Sobel-orientation, radial-FFT, and coherency comparison. The comparison figure shows the micrograph beside the spot field. Specimen-match is 86 rather than higher because the nonlinear pattern is a spot lattice, while the micrograph's coarse structure is a spiral whose ridge is 67.57 µm, deliberately not identified with 5.13 µm." ;
